            "review_title": "Review at Bien Tien Restaurant",
            "review_text": "gman2103\nSydney, Australia154 contributions\n0\nGreat local seafood\nFeb 2014 • Couples\nMy partner and I were warmly welcomed for a lunch after a hot morning cycling. The menu is like a novel with every seafood imaginable and other dishes as well. Prices are very reasonable, beer cheap and there are many wines and spirits.\n\nWe had tasty fresh spring rolls, mussels with ginger and lobster. Mussels were slightly overdone. Lobster was superb. (My partner is from NZ as wasn't quiet as blown away by the lobster as I but she wasn't disappointed.)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 2, 2014",
